    {
      "anchor": "compatibility-with-normal-servers-api-and-operations",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Compatibility with normal servers API and operations"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "compatibility-with-normal-servers-api-and-operations",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "For compatibility and interoperability reasons, all the operations are supported for normal servers and supported for the backfilling ones as well. See the Servers / VMs section for detailed documentation. In this regard, backfilling servers are a subset of all servers in the account. The API described in Servers / VMs applies to all servers (including the backfilling ones), but the API described in this section applies to backfilling servers only."
    },
